        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Clarify ARIA patterns for info icons with tooltips]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42677</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42677"/>
        <updated>2026-01-07T21:15:43.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172850314?u=aaf2eb089887aefa3504cf5ec76dea0ab798282f&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #42676.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3789841764" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42676" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/42676/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42676">#42676</a></p>
<p dir="auto">This PR adds missing guidance to the tooltip role documentation explaining the correct ARIA pattern for implementing "more info" icons (ⓘ) with tooltips.</p>
<h2 dir="auto">Changes</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Clarifies that the icon should be a <code class="notranslate">&lt;button&gt;</code> element, not have <code class="notranslate">role="tooltip"</code></li>
<li>Provides example for simple tooltips using <code class="notranslate">aria-describedby</code></li>
<li>Provides example for complex content using <code class="notranslate">role="dialog"</code></li>
<li>Explains key distinctions between proper and improper usage</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">This addresses the confusion raised in the linked issue and referenced Stack Overflow discussion about the correct ARIA role for info icons.</p>]]></content>
